      "params": [],
      "rightModuleId": 137,
      "text": "---------------------------------\nMASTER VOLUME\n---------------------------------\nUse the \"Level\" knob on the mixer in the lower right corner to control the master volume of this patch.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThis patch demonstrates the use of a signle voltage step sequencer to create both harmonic progression and a related arpeggio.\n\n-created by Daniel Dehaan.\n2021-10-17\n \n\n\n",
